{"id": "gsm8k-0003", "mode": "sealed", "key": 1, "doc_id": "gsm_guard90-gsm8k-0003", "text": "To find out how many total meters James runs in a week, let's break it down step by step:\n\n1. James runs 3 sprints each time he runs.\n2. Each sprint is 60 meters long.\n3. He runs 3 times a week.\n\nFirst, calculate the total distance for one run:\n\\[ 3 \\text{ sprints} \\times 60 \\text{ meters/sprint} = 180 \\text{ meters} \\]\n\nNext, since he runs 3 times a week, we multiply the total distance for one run by 3:\n\\[ 180 \\text{ meters/run} \\times 3 \\text{ runs/week} = 540 \\text{ meters/week} \\]\n\nSo, James runs a total of 540 meters a week.", "token": "ep1.pGFuTHIa2RSIPZ6MADPmXmF2AWJjdFkFS9_67V-lSLMW1QCkqc5qegkMr4wQOO2F1SJs8oLWSk69Pd1lpl-87qeL60C80JYQueQT_xuIiNR8OX9gPeYl2HFJh3720RDW5BF1QVVZV2q8GxNt9Jl8lzMSo7wyWi3XiehCVJRQP6wUCODDaf9qnFywN8m1Lj-ifDxPfLA0HP6lX4CrOX87Qz1f0kRGuamCPjPKoBHi6uXY20mVjAJfx7xGlSkbQd1hngRlz9ksa17onFvBhvvX8t_Ud9KAW37Gu6gEap0nAlY4QvQ9cnKqS-wV8A9E91Skie16H2LZkTWQKHfLGPfT-eHWzoZ-5KdRn9KyamHcUYV0nPyGvTbkUO0wxzBBZnDuIIhvEIXCa3aUYtgcWC79fj-gGPWZiy2dG2C92DnRHd6HcyfqDE9ta9An8kvb9owa27avrEFkMpRMFs30a2lVNxjnX435u6ZUmOcNQI5myBq1zRgPk-V49NmIJR5olcLHifJt_JQ-LKWYpYw8Zcb4AsjRyE0x_omRPJJMyMV2umGVTNl7hoCb7QR4VmcRS-JanpgbcHiWRp-Ojqo5UOYF_8FUjOBeWMv1evjOVIUZxUKUKu330dMDTTkmohut6aBMvDmzL5KD0lybgehs5RTsMkWhbcLyKktXjIwRWCQ3K_MTm5dXZr7EADaI9u_MABDvymuHn3lv2cIqHzZC2YDxDkGmfwrEnwF_oVWl8MR8oag3e-4Ld6onDUcAT6qV3_uXHnYK5NRp0wnarE9_7GhG5TN-FKR8ahGm3e67XJUVny7Rk5ytuPzKzMdpCdyGrFoLDS7KRJo-o1gbnjZKTFVvqE663H_FpBh6F2kqFKf0VVV_9nzwH11KKMSsNCbz6kt8gms_E22YhAXt9XqW0Cs2GWyTITyU-NVsubEkqZ4K6X99MyN8GmkYeaZEZVuRk_9iULwbzuZW6YOOrqLzkTYfpvHG4V153Le-bVuVYWwJw5veizIVqPCQLZ-JfnmRKTolw0xouKGUEPq7_NMfnO_TdfTvhtmr348XFvIr2yCJAXUf7LxDqYdxLb1FxhATmhDECY4HwzIjv__YZZ98a3pwm7IuuBG_x8U9KrOBBPWYwaABWJ_hw1qnlbO6MB1LNy8bQCAT-rRFB_eNjy7u9RSXdYLaiXKUOB2z4UHnQKKNZVKbkUTBhWhKIUXBzjo4vWGbJMa_QMo02SIpyR4KQrYRVQGeg1cUjcp_Hos5iKvebjM89DTkYCXuwYhgK7B5iL08xyglSmAbZmxaZeUEIw63w_BZ-f8GZX-N5hxTAbjGRkSGlwenVG